
Patch a metric group by key. Updating a metric group uses a JSON patch https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6902 representation of the desired changes.

Usage:
  ldcli metric-groups-beta update [flags]

Required flags:
  -d, --data string           Input data in JSON
      --metric-group string   The metric group key
      --project string        The project key

Global flags:
  -h, --help                  Get help about any command
      --access-token string   LaunchDarkly access token with write-level access
      --analytics-opt-out     Opt out of analytics tracking
      --base-uri string       LaunchDarkly base URI (default "https://app.launchdarkly.com")
      --fields strings        Comma-separated list of top-level fields to include in JSON output (e.g., --fields key,name,kind)
      --json                  Output JSON format (shorthand for --output json)
  -o, --output string         Output format: json, plaintext, or markdown (default: plaintext in a terminal, json otherwise) (default "json")
